        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: Takeaway Order and Pickup\n---\nsequenceDiagram\n  actor Customer\n  participant App as Mobile App\n  participant QR as QR Service\n  participant API as Order API\n  participant DB as Database\n  participant Kitchen\n  actor Chef\n\n  alt Advance pickup\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Select restaurant\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Browse menu\n  else Walk-in takeaway\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Scan outlet QR code\n    App-&gt;&gt;QR: validateQR(code)\n    QR-&gt;&gt;DB: Verify restaurant\n    DB--&gt;&gt;QR: Restaurant details\n    QR--&gt;&gt;App: Display menu\n  end\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Select food items\n  App-&gt;&gt;API: placeOrder(items, orderType)\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save order\n  DB--&gt;&gt;API: Order and pickup number\n  API-&gt;&gt;Kitchen: Send order\n  Kitchen--&gt;&gt;Chef: Display order\n  Chef-&gt;&gt;Kitchen: Accept and prepare order\n  Kitchen-&gt;&gt;API: Update preparation status\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save status\n  API--&gt;&gt;App: Update order status\n  App--&gt;&gt;Customer: Show order progress\n\n  Chef-&gt;&gt;Kitchen: Mark order ready\n  Kitchen-&gt;&gt;API: Update order to READY\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save ready status\n  API--&gt;&gt;App: Notify customer\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Show pickup QR / number\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;Kitchen: Collect food\n  Kitchen-&gt;&gt;API: Confirm collection\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Mark order COMPLETED\n  API--&gt;&gt;App: Collection successful&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="slELOddAaQzddNfufZQE-1">
